    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Advanced Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#122 with a clean milestone: 3,590 player-facing item labels, friendly category/station names, bounded wrapped descriptions, and reliable ESC/Backspace/controller-B exits. The new label TSV is included in the installer and queued superset build `E85AA9E20E284EECB7E580C6C767724B38FF335917CBF4447956E4E992D6DEDA`. This intentionally remains `actionable` even after installation: vanilla recipes still use safe Rockstar handoff rather than seamless one-click execution, and full station/transaction/UI acceptance remains.",
